        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Summon Night is a Japanese tactical RPG and the first entry in the Summon Night series. This game follows the story of a Japanese high schooler, who is suddenly summoned into the world of Lyndbaum. The main character gets involved in a series of conflicts between gangs, classes, factions and worlds. He/she has to use the power of summons to solve those problems while trying to return to his or her own homeworld.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Summon Night es un RPG táctico japonés y la primera entrega de la serie Summon Night. Este juego sigue la historia de un estudiante japonés de secundaria que de pronto es invocado al mundo de Lyndbaum. El personaje principal se ve envuelto en una serie de conflictos entre pandillas, clases, facciones y mundos. Debe usar el poder de las invocaciones para resolver esos problemas mientras intenta regresar a su propio mundo natal.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2000",
          "source": "igdb",
